    <string name="privacy_title">How hashiru uses health data</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">hashiru writes each finished treadmill walk to Health Connect: an exercise session with distance, steps, active and total calories, in one-minute steps. It reads your latest body weight only to estimate calories. Nothing leaves your phone, and you can remove walks from hashiru or Health Connect at any time.</string>
